1
00:00:03,216 --> 00:00:06,459
When a lead qualifies, click Convert on its row.

2
00:00:06,459 --> 00:00:10,963
The page says that a contact already has this lead's email, and Merge

3
00:00:10,963 --> 00:00:13,726
into is picked, so no duplicate is made.

4
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:19,225
The contact keeps its own values and only gains what the lead has that it lacks.

5
00:00:19,225 --> 00:00:24,660
The account starts from the lead's company, and Create an opportunity records the deal.

6
00:00:25,114 --> 00:00:31,237
Under Activities, choose to move the open activities to the contact, or to cancel them.

7
00:00:31,237 --> 00:00:32,554
Click Convert.

8
00:00:35,242 --> 00:00:39,598
For a lead nobody knows yet, choose Create a new contact and its

9
00:00:39,598 --> 00:00:43,518
type, create the account, and tick Create an opportunity.

10
00:00:43,518 --> 00:00:48,372
Pick the opportunity type, and enter a name, an amount and a close date.

11
00:00:49,587 --> 00:00:53,607
The lead takes the Converted status and becomes read-only.

12
00:00:53,607 --> 00:00:57,627
It leaves the Leads list, and the contact has its history.

